On Sep 14, 12:16=A0pm, Neil Rieck <n.ri...@sympatico.ca> wrote:
> On Sep 13, 1:55=A0am, Marc Schlensog <mschlens+n...@gmail.com> wrote:
>
> > Hi folks,
